{"product_id":"carried-away","title":"Carried Away","description":"\u003cp\u003eDaniel's uneventful life changes when he meets Jess. She's wild and adventurous, and persuades Daniel to burgle her house. When he's there, however, he meets a real burglar and finds himself caught up in a crazy chain of events, getting ever more involved in Jess's wild schemes. At first Daniel is apalled, but at the end of the book, when he has the chance to break free from Jess, he doesn't take it. Jess has changed his life. He has been carried away. BLMichael Harrison has published three previous novels with OUP, as well as a large number of best-selling anthologies BLPublished simultaneously with two other Michael Harrison thrillers, Facing the Dark and It's My Life, with strong new cover look\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Harrison\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780192719072\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45878987423897,"sku":"13RB9780192719072","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6911a87d63379_Carried_Away.jpg?v=1762792140","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/carried-away","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}